OL,3,GNEWSAIs kombucha really good for your
OL,4,Ahealth?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf you're a health-conscious type who
OL,7,Freaches for the products promising that
OL,8,Fboost, you may be a regular consumer of
OL,9,Fkombucha.
OL,11,FThe form of fermented tea has been
OL,12,Fdrunk for centuries in parts of Asia
OL,13,Fand is now being touted as a superfood
OL,14,Fto improve lots of aspects of health,
OL,15,Fincluding gut bacteria, the immune
OL,16,Fsystem and even lowering stress.
OL,18,FBut where is the evidence? Is there
OL,19,Fsomething special in the bottles of the
OL,20,Fdrink now easily available in your
OL,21,Flocal supermarket?
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
