OL,3,GNEWSAIs kombucha really good for your
OL,4,Ahealth?
OL,5,
OL,6,FResearchers at Aberystwyth University
OL,7,Fhave led a study trying to establish
OL,8,Fwhat happens to a person when they
OL,9,Fdrink kombucha for a sustained period
OL,10,Fof time, to see if the drink does have
OL,11,Fany measurable impact on the body.
